This directory contains the following Elan programs:

TURTLE    Turtle graphics packet (to be read with 'p').
ROSETTE   Needs packet 'turtle'.
PEANO     Peano curves, needs packet 'turtle'.
PYTH      Pythagoras trees, needs packet 'turtle'.
SIERPIN   Sierpinski triangle, needs packet 'turtle'.

